{"code":"016800","name":"퍼시스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"가구","sector_desc":"가구·인테리어. 주택 거래량과 이사 수요에 연동됩니다.","desc":"동사는 1983년 설립된 사무가구 제조업체로, 1996년 유가증권시장에 상장하였으며 2개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 국내 사무가구 시장에서 약 6.5% 점유율을 차지하고, 250여 개 전문 유통 대리점을 통해 영업망을 구축하며 38개국에 FURSYS 브랜드로 수출하고 있음. 동사는 제조 역량과 자동화를 통해 품질 차별화를 추구하고, 해외 활로 개척으로 글로벌 브랜드 입지를 다지고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":24500.0,"open":23250.0,"high":24850.0,"low":23000.0,"volume":1899,"amount":46525500.0,"ret_1d":-0.8097,"gap":-5.8704,"range_pct":7.551,"ret_5":3.1579,"ret_20":-2.7778,"ret_60":-8.0675,"ret_120":-33.0601,"ret_250":-48.2577,"ma20":24232.5,"ma60":26030.0,"ma120":27365.0,"ma200":32764.5,"close_vs_ma200":-25.2239,"close_vs_ma60":-5.8778,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-40.2728,"r2_60":0.3918,"slope_120":-40.2544,"r2_120":0.5116,"slope_250":-55.4094,"r2_250":0.9039,"high52":50800.0,"low52":22350.0,"pos_52w":7.5571,"dd_52w":-51.7717,"mdd_1y":-52.8827,"atr14_pct":6.3557,"vol_ann_60":27.782,"vol_avg20":958.05,"vol_ratio20":1.9822,"vr5":0.9239,"vr20":0.7738,"amount_avg5":20275340.0,"amount_avg20":23231697.5,"amount_avg60":23653855.8333,"obv_chg20":-6.1531,"turnover_20":0.1666,"pv_eff_20":-16.6716,"rsi14":46.5777,"frgn_net_5":-138.0,"inst_net_5":748.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0012,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0065,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0053,"frgn_net_20":338.0,"inst_net_20":-618.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0029,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0054,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0024,"frgn_net_60":-3002.0,"inst_net_60":-508.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0261,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0044,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0305,"frgn_net_120":-4637.0,"inst_net_120":-14855.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0403,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1292,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.1695,"foreign_ratio":20.09,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.04,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":-54.0,"op_margin_q":-6.1644,"op_qoq":-157.1429,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-2800.0,"rev_yoy":6.4399,"op_trend_4q":-49.4118,"fin_period":"202606","roe":10.02,"debt_ratio":12.81,"per":4.68,"pbr":0.35,"div_yield":4